# Project Classification: helm-charts
CLASS: private
SCOPE: proprietary-helm-chart-repository
BOUNDARIES:
  - TYPE: proprietary
  - INTERNAL_ONLY: false
  - CAN_IMPORT_OSS: true

FORBIDDEN:
  - Charts or files of proprietary products that are not published here (zen-watcher, zen-lead)
  - zen-platform/* references in chart docs
  - Private API endpoints
  - PM/admin documentation
  - Completion reports
  - Roadmaps, audits, source-of-truth records, inventories

ALLOWED:
  - Helm chart definitions
  - Component charts
  - User-facing chart documentation
  - Chart metadata

DOCUMENTATION_RULES:
  - Chart documentation only
  - Say what a chart does and how to configure it; never how a component works inside
  - NO PM/admin docs
